<h1>The revival so far</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Written 2026-10-08 for the curator. Dates are 2026, times UTC. Each part ends with its sources.</p>
</header>

<nav class="parts" aria-label="Parts">
<h2>Six parts</h2>
<ol>
<li><a href="#part1">The start and the exploring era</a></li>
<li><a href="#part2">The unsealed tree and the batches</a></li>
<li><a href="#part3">How the record grew</a></li>
<li><a href="#part4">Since 10-04: the skills and the process</a></li>
<li><a href="#part5">What the revival changed in Fortress</a></li>
